1830", "author": {"steamid": "76561197970805958", "personaname": "Techpriest Dakkajak", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197970805958/", "num_games_owned": 313, "num_reviews": 13, "playtime_forever": 552, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 552, "last_played": 1446213828, "avatar": "80c0a694d7986d901df2a09159f0d5eca34f9635"}, "language": "english", "review": "A game faithful to the 40K universe but a little too repetitive to be wholly enjoyable.\n\nStep into the power armor of a super human Space Marine to fight off an Ork invasion with a little more direction than usual for the greenskin menace.\n\nBasically a classic hack and slash style game set in the 40K universe, Space Marine is a beautiful game to behold with artistic inspiration taken and faithfully recreated. However, the hack and slash style with very infrequent plot developments make it very tedious after a while.\n\nI recommend it to all 40K fans, but caution people unfamiliar with the universe that this game isn't incredibly fun.", "timestamp_created": 1474475796, "timestamp_updated": 1474475796, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}]}